{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_35","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"action\": \"no_action\",\n  \"summary\": \"No additional setup is required: core dependencies are transitively resolved, and the existing scaffold already provides Docker-image and Testcontainers configuration. JUnit 5 integration is optional because lifecycle control can be manual. [Artifact dependencies](https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.testcontainers/testcontainers/1.19.8/dependencies) [Documentation](https://java.testcontainers.org/)\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"Exercise real Docker-backed container lifecycle behavior using the existing testcontainers.properties and required-docker-images.txt setup. Do not skip Docker-dependent tests or disable their native execution; use manual start/stop lifecycle control unless the existing JUnit integration dependency is already present.\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"A Docker-API-compatible runtime and working socket remain required for meaningful Testcontainers coverage.\"\n  ]\n}"}}
